{"id":"bbce3cb75d3e9dbc","group":"14","path":"14/14-thm-continuous-action-coreflection-and-exponentials.md","title":"Theorem — 连续作用的核反射与指数","display":"Theorem — 连续作用的核反射与指数","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Sheaves in Geometry and Logic (Mac Lane & Moerdijk)","book_abbrev":"14","label":"14-thm-continuous-action-coreflection-and-exponentials","aliases":["14-thm-continuous-action-coreflection-and-exponentials"],"display":"Theorem — 连续作用的核反射与指数","source_ref":"I, Exercise 6, pp.62–63; III.9","source_status":"来源定位沿用附件笔记；本次未重新核验原书文件。","verification_status":"assistant-semantic-review; not-proof-assistant-checked","depends_on":["[[14-df-adjoint-functors]]","[[14-df-continuous-discrete-actions]]","[[14-df-group-action-exponentials]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Sheaves in Geometry and Logic (Mac Lane &amp; Moerdijk)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"14"},{"key":"label","html":"14-thm-continuous-action-coreflection-and-exponentials"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>14-thm-continuous-action-coreflection-and-exponentials</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"Theorem — 连续作用的核反射与指数"},{"key":"source_ref","html":"I, Exercise 6, pp.62–63; III.9"},{"key":"source_status","html":"来源定位沿用附件笔记；本次未重新核验原书文件。"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"assistant-semantic-review; not-proof-assistant-checked"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"d2b4e5cf16585f95\" href=\"?note=d2b4e5cf16585f95\" title=\"14-df-adjoint-functors\">14-df-adjoint-functors</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"b15595c6868517ce\" href=\"?note=b15595c6868517ce\" title=\"14-df-continuous-discrete-actions\">14-df-continuous-discrete-actions</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"dd3ceef5571a783f\" href=\"?note=dd3ceef5571a783f\" title=\"14-df-group-action-exponentials\">14-df-group-action-exponentials</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"G,\\mu,e,\\iota,\\tau_G\">\\(G,\\mu,e,\\iota,\\tau_G\\)</span> 沿用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"b15595c6868517ce\" href=\"?note=b15595c6868517ce\" title=\"14-df-continuous-discrete-actions\">14-df-continuous-discrete-actions</a> 的拓扑群数据。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"i:BG_{\\mathrm{cts}}\\to BG\">\\(i:BG_{\\mathrm{cts}}\\to BG\\)</span> 为满包含。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X=(|X|,\\rho_X)\">\\(X=(|X|,\\rho_X)\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X&#39;=(|X&#39;|,\\rho_{X&#39;})\">\\(X&#39;=(|X&#39;|,\\rho_{X&#39;})\\)</span> 为任意带作用对象，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f\\in\\operatorname{Hom}_{BG}(X,X&#39;)\">\\(f\\in\\operatorname{Hom}_{BG}(X,X&#39;)\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"b_G\">\\(b_G\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"ff1dddefb4838916\" href=\"?note=ff1dddefb4838916\" title=\"14-df-right-group-actions\">14-df-right-group-actions</a>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X_{\\mathrm{cts}}\">\\(X_{\\mathrm{cts}}\\)</span> 为下式定义的子集，稳定子精确签名见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"b15595c6868517ce\" href=\"?note=b15595c6868517ce\" title=\"14-df-continuous-discrete-actions\">14-df-continuous-discrete-actions</a>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"r\">\\(r\\)</span> 是以下定义的函子。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"W,Y,Z\">\\(W,Y,Z\\)</span> 为连续作用对象，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(-)^{(-)}_{BG}\">\\((-)^{(-)}_{BG}\\)</span> 采用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"dd3ceef5571a783f\" href=\"?note=dd3ceef5571a783f\" title=\"14-df-group-action-exponentials\">14-df-group-action-exponentials</a> 的带结构指数。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\iota_X:X_{\\mathrm{cts}}\\hookrightarrow|X|\">\\(\\iota_X:X_{\\mathrm{cts}}\\hookrightarrow|X|\\)</span> 为集合包含函数；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"v\\in\\operatorname{Hom}_{BG}(iY,X)\">\\(v\\in\\operatorname{Hom}_{BG}(iY,X)\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"k\\in\\operatorname{Hom}_{BG_{\\mathrm{cts}}}(Y,rX)\">\\(k\\in\\operatorname{Hom}_{BG_{\\mathrm{cts}}}(Y,rX)\\)</span>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"X_{\\mathrm{cts}}=\\{x\\in|X|:\\operatorname{Stab}_G(|X|,\\rho_X,x)\\in\\tau_G\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[X_{\\mathrm{cts}}=\\{x\\in|X|:\\operatorname{Stab}_G(|X|,\\rho_X,x)\\in\\tau_G\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"r_0(X)=(X_{\\mathrm{cts}},\\rho_X|_{X_{\\mathrm{cts}}\\times G}),\\qquad r_1(f)=(r_0(X),r_0(X&#39;),b_G(f)|_{X_{\\mathrm{cts}}}).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[r_0(X)=(X_{\\mathrm{cts}},\\rho_X|_{X_{\\mathrm{cts}}\\times G}),\\qquad r_1(f)=(r_0(X),r_0(X&#39;),b_G(f)|_{X_{\\mathrm{cts}}}).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"r=(r_0,r_1).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[r=(r_0,r_1).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\Phi_{Y,X}(v)=(Y,r(X),b_G(v)),\\qquad\\Psi_{Y,X}(k)=(iY,X,\\iota_X\\circ b_G(k)).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\Phi_{Y,X}(v)=(Y,r(X),b_G(v)),\\qquad\\Psi_{Y,X}(k)=(iY,X,\\iota_X\\circ b_G(k)).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\Phi_{Y,X}:\\operatorname{Hom}_{BG}(iY,X)\\xrightarrow{\\sim}\\operatorname{Hom}_{BG_{\\mathrm{cts}}}(Y,rX),\\qquad\\Psi_{Y,X}=\\Phi_{Y,X}^{-1},\\qquad \\operatorname{IsAdjunction}(i,r).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\Phi_{Y,X}:\\operatorname{Hom}_{BG}(iY,X)\\xrightarrow{\\sim}\\operatorname{Hom}_{BG_{\\mathrm{cts}}}(Y,rX),\\qquad\\Psi_{Y,X}=\\Phi_{Y,X}^{-1},\\qquad \\operatorname{IsAdjunction}(i,r).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"Z^{Y}_{BG_{\\mathrm{cts}}}=r((iZ)^{iY}_{BG}),\\qquad\\operatorname{Hom}_{BG_{\\mathrm{cts}}}(W\\times Y,Z)\\cong\\operatorname{Hom}_{BG_{\\mathrm{cts}}}(W,Z^{Y}_{BG_{\\mathrm{cts}}}).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[Z^{Y}_{BG_{\\mathrm{cts}}}=r((iZ)^{iY}_{BG}),\\qquad\\operatorname{Hom}_{BG_{\\mathrm{cts}}}(W\\times Y,Z)\\cong\\operatorname{Hom}_{BG_{\\mathrm{cts}}}(W,Z^{Y}_{BG_{\\mathrm{cts}}}).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{IsFunctor}(r,BG,BG_{\\mathrm{cts}}).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{IsFunctor}(r,BG,BG_{\\mathrm{cts}}).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"r\">\\(r\\)</span> 的对象值保留限制后的作用，箭头值保留连续作用对象标签。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Phi\">\\(\\Phi\\)</span> 中底层函数的值域可收窄，正由以下开稳定子论证保证；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Psi\">\\(\\Psi\\)</span> 再与包含函数复合，因而两个输出均属于所写 Hom。</p>\n<p>若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f:Y\\to X\">\\(f:Y\\to X\\)</span> 等变，则 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"G_y\\subseteq G_{f(y)}\">\\(G_y\\subseteq G_{f(y)}\\)</span>。包含开子群的子群是其开陪集的并，故开；于是 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f\">\\(f\\)</span> 唯一落入 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"rX\">\\(rX\\)</span>，给出伴随。连续作用的有限乘积具有有限交的开稳定子，故包含函子保持有限积。将普通作用范畴指数的伴随与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"i\\dashv r\">\\(i\\dashv r\\)</span> 合成，就得到上式指数。这里不能把所有集合函数都直接作为连续作用指数，必须取其开稳定子部分。</p>\n<p>来源：Mac Lane–Moerdijk，I, Exercise 6, pp.62–63; III.9。此处来源定位沿用所附笔记；本次未获得所列原书文件。数学结构及必要条件以本条 Hypothesis 和 Assertion 为准。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"14-df-adjoint-functors","status":"resolved","id":"d2b4e5cf16585f95","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[14-df-adjoint-functors]]","embed":false},{"target":"14-df-continuous-discrete-actions","status":"resolved","id":"b15595c6868517ce","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[14-df-continuous-discrete-actions]]","embed":false},{"target":"14-df-group-action-exponentials","status":"resolved","id":"dd3ceef5571a783f","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[14-df-group-action-exponentials]]","embed":false},{"target":"14-df-continuous-discrete-actions","status":"resolved","id":"b15595c6868517ce","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$G,\\mu,e,\\iota,\\tau_G$ 沿用 [[14-df-continuous-discrete-actions]] 的拓扑群数据。$i:BG_{\\mathrm{cts}}\\to BG$ 为满包含。$X=(|X|,\\rho_X)$、$X'=(|X'|,\\rho_{X'})$ 为任意带作用对象，$f\\in\\operatorname{Hom}_{BG}(X,X')$；$b_G$ 见 [[14-df-right-group-actions]]。$X_{\\mathrm{cts}}$ 为下式定义的子集，稳定子精确签名见 [[14-df-continuous-discrete-actions]]。$r$ 是以下定义的函子。$W,Y,Z$ 为连续作用对象，$(-)^{(-)}_{BG}$ 采用 [[14-df-group-action-exponentials]] 的带结构指数。$\\iota_X:X_{\\mathrm{cts}}\\hookrightarrow|X|$ 为集合包含函数；$v\\in\\operatorname{Hom}_{BG}(iY,X)$、$k\\in\\operatorname{Hom}_{BG_{\\mathrm{cts}}}(Y,rX)$。","embed":false},{"target":"14-df-right-group-actions","status":"resolved","id":"ff1dddefb4838916","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","